      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the most general type that can be passed to the\n<a href=\"../../Expression.html#setValue(org.springframework.expression.EvaluationContext,java.lang.Object,java.lang.Object)\"><code>Expression.setValue(EvaluationContext, Object, Object)</code></a> method for the given context.",
      "translation": "返回可以传递给给定上下文的 <a href=\"../../Expression.html#setValue(org.springframework.expression.EvaluationContext,java.lang.Object,java.lang.Object)\"><code>Expression.setValue(EvaluationContext, Object, Object)</code></a> 方法的最通用类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a descriptor for the most general type that can be passed to the\n<a href=\"../../Expression.html#setValue(org.springframework.expression.EvaluationContext,java.lang.Object,java.lang.Object)\"><code>Expression.setValue(EvaluationContext, Object, Object)</code></a> method for the given\ncontext.",
      "translation": "返回一个描述符，该描述符对应于可以传递给给定上下文的<a href=\"../../Expression.html#setValue(org.springframework.expression.EvaluationContext,java.lang.Object,java.lang.Object)\"><code>Expression.setValue(EvaluationContext, Object, Object)</code></a>方法的最通用类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>SpelExpression</code> represents a parsed (valid) expression that is ready to be\nevaluated in a specified context. An expression can be evaluated standalone or in a\nspecified context. During expression evaluation the context may be asked to resolve\nreferences to types, beans, properties, and methods.",
      "translation": "`SpelExpression` 表示一个已解析（有效）且准备在指定上下文中求值的表达式。表达式可以独立求值或在指定上下文中求值。在表达式求值期间，可能会请求上下文解析对类型、Bean、属性和方法的引用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a descriptor for the most general type that can be passed to one of\nthe <code>setValue(...)</code> methods using the default context.",
      "translation": "返回一个描述符，用于指定使用默认上下文时可以传递给其中一个 `<code>setValue(...)</code>` 方法的最通用类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct an expression, only used by the parser.",
      "translation": "构建一个仅由解析器使用的表达式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the Abstract Syntax Tree for the expression.",
      "translation": "返回该表达式的抽象语法树。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the default evaluation context that will be used if none is supplied on an evaluation call.",
      "translation": "返回默认评估上下文，如果在评估调用中未提供该上下文。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the original string used to create this expression (unmodified).",
      "translation": "返回用于创建此表达式的原始字符串（未修改）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Evaluate this expression in the provided context against the specified root object\nand return the result of evaluation.",
      "translation": "在提供的上下文中评估此表达式，并返回评估结果。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the evaluation context that will be used if none is specified on an evaluation call.",
      "translation": "设置评估上下文，如果在评估调用中未指定则使用此上下文。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set this expression in the default context to the value provided.",
      "translation": "将此表达式在默认上下文中设置为提供的值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine if this expression can be written to, i.e. setValue() can be called.",
      "translation": "确定是否可以写入此表达式，即是否可以调用 setValue()。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Perform expression compilation. This will only succeed once exit descriptors for\nall nodes have been determined. If the compilation fails and has failed more than\n100 times the expression is no longer considered suitable for compilation.",
      "translation": "执行表达式编译。仅当所有节点的退出描述符均已确定后，此操作才会成功。如果编译失败且失败次数超过 100 次，则该表达式不再被视为适合编译。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Cause an expression to revert to being interpreted if it has been using a compiled\nform. It also resets the compilation attempt failure count (an expression is normally no\nlonger considered compilable if it cannot be compiled after 100 attempts).",
      "translation": "使表达式重新被解释，如果它之前使用的是编译形式。它还会重置编译尝试失败计数（如果无法在 100 次尝试后编译成功，表达式通常不再被视为可编译）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Produce a string representation of the Abstract Syntax Tree for the expression.\nThis should ideally look like the input expression, but properly formatted since any\nunnecessary whitespace will have been discarded during the parse of the expression.",
      "translation": "生成表达式的抽象语法树 (Abstract Syntax Tree) 的字符串表示形式。\n理想情况下，其外观应与输入表达式相似，但由于解析表达式期间会丢弃任何不必要的空白字符，因此需要正确格式化。",
      "count": 2
    },
